# RF0: store every tracked file BYTE-VERBATIM. The guards in _dpsm_work hash
# file contents (git_free_code_hash in n0_acceptance.py, the corpus manifest)
# and several historical files are deliberately NOT valid UTF-8, so a CRLF or
# encoding rewrite on checkout would silently break a guard. No text=auto, no
# eol conversion.
#
# -text only: text DIFFS must keep working -- RF2/RF3 review a mechanical split
# by reading the diff, and `-diff` would print "Binary files differ" for every
# source file and hide exactly the review this baseline exists to support.
* -text
